 "text": "MACOG Maps - Data\n-->\n-->\nSkip Navigation\nAdd to Favorites\nTranslate\nAdd to Favorites\nTranslate\nClose\nSign In\nRecent Downloads\nHome\nMore\nHome\nMAPS & DATA\nGeographic Information System (GIS) | Data Dashboards | Story Maps\nFeatured Mapping Applications\nMain GIS Map\nProperty Viewer\nRegional Traffic Counts\nInteractive Story Maps\nData can be helpful to understand complex concepts and help make decisions. Story Maps can help you understand the data in the right context and give you a clearer picture. Feel free to explore the Stories to learn more about the work at MACOG.\nTransportation Data\nMACOG has a long history of collecting, analyzing, and sharing data on our transportation network. Use these interactive maps and dashboards to better understand our region's transportation network system.\nCommunity Development Data\nLocal communities utilize GIS for management and analysis. Use the following maps and dashboards to explore locally available data.\nSustainability Data\nOver the last several years, MACOG has continued to respond to local and regional concerns as it relates to sustainability and the environment. Explore maps and data relating to solar energy, brownfield inventory, and other related topics.\nContact Information\nmaps@macog.com\nHome\nTerms of Service\nPrivacy Policy\nContact Us\n© 2023 Michiana Area Council of Governments\nExplore Feeds\nTranslate",
